      "reasoning": "Learner is at the start of a faded example. They need to recall that alkanes are non-polar and only experience London dispersion forces. First diagnostic step: ask them to identify the polarity of oktaan’s molecule — this primes the correct reasoning path without giving the answer. [TOOL CHECK: none needed; conceptual]",
